@startuml
left to right direction
actor "Customer demo" as C
actor "Staff demo" as S
actor "Unauthenticated reader
(local demo only)" as R
rectangle "v0.3.1 implemented" {
 usecase "Create order
FR-01" as CREATE
 usecase "Lookup order by ORD
FR-01" as QUERY
 usecase "Confirm order
FR-02 implemented part" as CONFIRM
 usecase "Start picking" as PICK
 usecase "Ship and generate waybill" as SHIP
 usecase "Read tracking" as TRACK
 usecase "Simulate carrier pickup/delivery" as SIM
}
C -- CREATE
R -- QUERY
R -- TRACK
S -- CONFIRM
S -- PICK
S -- SHIP
S -- SIM
rectangle "Design retained / NOT implemented" {
 usecase "Cancel order
FR-02 pending part" as CANCEL
}
C -- CANCEL
S -- CANCEL
note bottom of CANCEL
CREATED: Customer cancellation
CONFIRMED: Staff/Customer cancellation
No endpoint in this release.
Future customer ownership must be enforced.
end note
note bottom of R
Actual GET endpoints have no ownership check.
Navigation is not authentication.
end note
@enduml
